# graphify scan exclusions (separate from .gitignore; never affects git/deploy)
# Keep this a CODE-ONLY corpus so graphify runs in AST mode at 0 tokens / fully local.
# Docs + images require semantic (LLM) extraction; excluded on purpose.
# To include them later, run a local pass: graphify . --backend ollama
*.md
*.mdx
*.txt
*.svg
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.ico
